<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan forces bombed an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels, while a U.S. drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, causing at least 20 deaths. The United States is negotiating a legal framework for troops in Caracas, coordinating drone strikes on cartels with Venezuelan authorities, and discussing a one-day operation to capture Maduro. Rubio said U.S. talks aim to establish a military presence in Venezuela and that elections would ideally be held next year. President Trump defended the Hegseth amid an impeachment threat, citing successful operations in Iran and Venezuela. 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPRkdYaklER2lEbFRnMVdoTmllTERsU3JhN1ZuUkE4ZWZISEdIa0s1YVNuUmVXWTJTcThLM01leVdBWTZSdVFZdVNsOXQ5TU5TV0ZJMllNT3ZPUWxQU256MDRVVEdrX1BTdzhPSnNfQzc0VWhKb2ttMWxDYVA1R3I3d1hFM1o4a0dqNzdwcUtQSm13dldxOWxndHZzaFQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOb19kbjZoNTBPaGNqNUFKeFZYR2dzOWlNN0ZfS0hRUC1zWUR5TWgwM3pnWmtTSGNDcEsybFVwUktHY1BSQ0pxOTdvLVZFbC1Gc25KVjBLbWNUZTVOejhpZjhUajU2emRCSU1CZHVkdU44Znh2b21WQnhPTWM5YllzM2kwSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOaC1GUGxuS1lKOVB0eGwtTXpCbXdBTjJmekRoWkhVYWM1cmN3YmJkWVVnREZmT0w3eHVXd0x0UXZaQmdnVm9qSzdUODJIYTBOcE55ODZ1THlPTGVhcU1tbm45am5NT1JxakNzbkxXUVR5R2RkX0NsWVo4TDQ5bms0aVoxUmJYbFdkN1RpanRjWDk1SnczX3JiWHpkV0I1VzZqQlJiVnJ4M0I0TXM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9tTXcyNURzVGxtU2pOcm5HMzhwRmtLNUlvWlBIbTB6WnJHUzNjMFhuTnVQWmg2VUR5NkFlZU5WMG9RZ0FzR045Rk1Iby1CUmgxRkUtRjA1MmVFbWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BigGo Finance&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/a